PTX MP+fence-restrict-cluster+shared
"fence.acquire.sync_restrict::shared::cluster orders P1's later load of its own CTA's shared memory after the flag (the shared::cluster space contains the CTA's own shared memory, D18). Expected: forbidden."
{
s=0 @cta 1;
f=0;
P1:r0=0;
P1:r1=0;
}
 P0@cta 0,cluster 0,gpu 0     | P1@cta 1,cluster 0,gpu 0                             ;
 st.weak.shared::cluster s, 1 | ld.relaxed.cluster r0, f                             ;
 fence.acq_rel.cluster        | fence.acquire.sync_restrict::shared::cluster.cluster ;
 st.relaxed.cluster f, 1      | ld.weak.shared::cta r1, s                            ;
exists
(P1:r0 == 1 /\ P1:r1 == 0)
